{"id":"vod_sn_39183","vodId":"39183","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"守护甜心!","name_cn":"守护甜心!","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e1e6acb7c614dc9c2e2b134016f0e0f0.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在圣夜学院中，亚梦（伊藤加奈惠 配音）是校园里有名的“刺头”，因为她不仅外表凶狠凌厉，有时说话还十分毒舌。然而，这却并非真实的亚梦。亚梦其实十分胆小害羞，她不过是用强硬的外在作为伪装，将其变成能够自我保护的堡垒罢了。　　终于有一天，亚梦再也无法忍受生活中旁人对她的诸多误会和误解了，她决定改变，亚梦向“守护灵”祈愿，希望自己的愿望能够成真。让亚梦没有想到的是，第二天，她的床上竟然多了三只守护蛋，守护蛋里装着的，是三名可爱善良的“守护甜心”——小兰（阿澄佳奈 配音）、美琪（加藤奈奈绘 配音）和小丝（丰崎爱生）。在他们的帮助下，亚梦能否重塑自己的形象呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/300D7XTL0D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Pcmu1Uegpc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/60KxLJw8Gf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8tbnL9azZe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P4G9cNLaQc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bSAQjqaYQg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RFd1JBRYYt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6TRpeZcQ1L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TWcE2AUrU61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nXS1FdGx4L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SWRZgya7zb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bfjPH7zXb91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/szURwyVxjz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r4yA8a8jaz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url